ualified final: main eff 1.0032 vs baseline 0.8166, control 1.0002, validity 1.0). Rejected (a) rule-ranking/required-investment-by-rule headline: no per-rule data retained; (b) search-progression narrative: forbidden and weaker. Flagged references.bib lacking starter literature. No failure decision: story is thin but coherent when narrowed.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
